# Template blocks (`>>`) — multiline prompts in a single LLM run

>> What's the [capital] of Turkey?
What's the [population: int] of <capital>?

@chain_facts(topic: str):
  >> Introduce [headline] about <topic>.
  Expand on <headline> with [detail].

  >> Summarize <detail> in [conclusion: str].
  = <conclusion>

= <chain_facts(`"Kedi DSL"`)>
